// MF_STATIC sections 3-8,10,12-13: cells, roles, typing, containment, routes,
// canonical object and DRC; MF_EXEC sections 6-9: concrete frame consumption.
// Bounded by 116 L01-L06/L08-L12, 117 W01-W04 and 096 sections 1-3:
// source-derived generated work, no type-product domain or host placement.
// A1-A10/B1-B3/D2 determine world incidence, genesis and completing lifts.
// C1-C5/D1 exclude retired geometry; CANON governs concrete hardware contacts.
// The 105-cell basis is NOT-SAME the 480-flag carrier. Physical containment
// checks do not define W. Proposal/basis checking remains D2:55-89, not V3.2.
//
// O_JTP_OBLIGATION_CONSTRUCTION bindings:
// MF_EXEC sections 5-11,17 and MF_GAME section 9: legal ingress, routed roles,
// partial-input custody, durable egress and named outstanding obligations.
