// V3.2 fabric-edit admission, including LA01-LA08 and CA01-CA02, is excluded
// from D2 lift selection. No metric threshold becomes an A4 gate admission rule.
// DEMO-003 toy-game content (Boolean observations, enemy actions, integer-grid
// GAME_APPLY) is excluded. Its committed-successor boundary alone is reused.
// Contact-GR and summed-flex world laws are excluded by C1-C5/D1.
// Historical Python realizations supply definition/genealogy and evidence only.
