// The summary binds receipt IDs, not individual receipt hashes; the hashes above
// bind the inspected receipts at the pinned commit, not an invented older manifest.
// Their contents supply the seven stated contracts and recorded observations.
// UNRESOLVED_ORIGINAL_DOCUMENT_BYTES: summary source_bindings names
// FABRIC_SPEC_v0.1.0-candidate-r2.md
// SHA256 E328B574DE32635358AC488C4C5E20E80E86A845EB154401C8E1A7C0DD8D68F1
// and FABRIC_CONFORMANCE_VECTORS_v0.1.0-r2-final.md
